{"kind":"finding","id":"F-recording-tree-010-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/QuickloadResumeTests.cs","line":376,"method":"CommitPendingTree_ResetsStateToFinalized","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RecordingStore.cs:2806; delete `pendingTreeState = PendingTreeState.Finalized;` -> still green, because ResetForTesting at test line 381 empties the slot so only the null-pending guard at RecordingStore.cs:2798 executes","what_it_asserts":"With no pending tree (ResetForTesting just ran), CommitPendingTree is called and PendingTreeStateValue is asserted to be Finalized.","why_weak":"The test never commits anything: the MakeTree result at line 378 is discarded and the slot is reset, so the assertion cannot fail for the behavior the name claims. TreeCommitTests.cs:1277 covers real commit side effects but stashes with the default Finalized state, so the Limbo->commit->Finalized reset stays unwitnessed.","proposed_action":"Stash a tree with PendingTreeState.Limbo (headless-safe, TreeCommitTests.cs:1282 proves CommitTree runs under xUnit), call CommitPendingTree, then assert Finalized + !HasPendingTree + tree committed; or rename the cell to CommitPendingTree_NoPendingTree_NoOp.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"FlightRecorder","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/FlightRecorder.cs","sut_line":686,"case_kind":"negative","proposed_name":"TryGetTailTrackSectionEnvironment_NoQualifyingSection_ReturnsFalse","sketch":"Recording rec with one TrackSection { frames = null, checkpoints = null, startUT = 10.0, endUT = 10.0 }; Assert.False(FlightRecorder.TryGetTailTrackSectionEnvironment(rec, out _)); also Assert.False(FlightRecorder.TryGetTailTrackSectionEnvironment(null, out _)).","guards":"The false arm that makes PrepareQuickloadResumeStateIfNeeded skip ArmRestoreEnvironmentResync (FlightRecorder.cs:512-514). Only the true arm is pinned (QuickloadResumeTests.cs:857), so an always-true or wrong-env regression on an env-less resume leaves the suite green.","risk":"recording"}
